@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health check → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Create short URL → 201 + Location
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/some/very/long/path?x=1" }

### 3. Redirect → 302 (see note on redirects)
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{create.response.body.code}}


### 4. Stats → 200, clickCount goes up after each run of #3
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/urls/{{create.response.body.code}}/stats

### 5. Create with surrounding whitespace → 201, URL stripped
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "   https://example.com/padded   " }

### --- Error cases ---

### 6. Invalid scheme → 400 with errors[]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "ftp://x.com" }

### 7. Blank URL → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "   " }

### 8. Missing field → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Malformed JSON → 400 "Malformed JSON request body"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url":

### 10. Wrong content type → 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls
Content-Type: text/plain

https://example.com

### 11. Unknown code → 404 problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/Zz9Zz9Z

### 12. Invalid code shape → 404 (never hits the DB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc

### 13. Stats for unknown code → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/urls/Zz9Zz9Z/stats

### 14. Wrong method → 405
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### --- Docs ---

### 15. OpenAPI spec → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs